/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f73ab691/uploads/origins/51b9275e-0c82-4da0-a733-e015b37009b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b951ae947ec230221b8e1681e41498eb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f73ab691/uploads/origins/51b9275e-0c82-4da0-a733-e015b37009b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b951ae947ec230221b8e1681e41498eb, https://si.imgix.net/f73ab691/uploads/origins/51b9275e-0c82-4da0-a733-e015b37009b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c9ca68fe20ba7bf2c13f39194a1d797 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f73ab691/uploads/origins/51b9275e-0c82-4da0-a733-e015b37009b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2adf13bd04453f7dfa86025e4760a54 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "女の子の似顔絵をアイコンをお願いします！！\nパステルカラーが好きみたいです。特に水色とからしいです。\nフルートを持たせてください！！\n誕プレにしまーす！！\n\n写真の下の子です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1KR40tVTJg_VyeQr33BmKumLw8aGzYsta/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ano_ko/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1cd25ad8/uploads/origins/e74898a7-b229-4402-8081-3f453d9ffce0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94e17b3a017a94b72766de188903e5c7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1cd25ad8/uploads/origins/e74898a7-b229-4402-8081-3f453d9ffce0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94e17b3a017a94b72766de188903e5c7, https://si.imgix.net/1cd25ad8/uploads/origins/e74898a7-b229-4402-8081-3f453d9ffce0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcac48a4df6395443c36ddc3ea043eb7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1cd25ad8/uploads/origins/e74898a7-b229-4402-8081-3f453d9ffce0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83a5ae73c9a18a943b03b1e1893a386e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "柚木ちゃんと愛染君\n2人が遊園地デートしてる感じのも